# [[ .AppName ]]

This workspace is an Eden fullstack app with a Go backend and Flutter frontend.

## Package Responsibilities

- `cmd/app/` — Go backend server entry point; registers ConnectRPC handlers
- Flutter app (`lib/`) — UI built on eden_platform_flutter and eden_ui_flutter

## Source of Truth

- Backend/frontend contracts are defined in `proto/`
- Run `eden generate` after modifying `.proto` files to regenerate clients

## Commands

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `eden setup` | Install dependencies (go mod download, flutter pub get) |
| `eden generate` | Regenerate code from protobuf definitions |
| `eden test` | Run all tests (Go + Flutter) |
| `eden lint` | Run linters (go vet, flutter analyze) |
| `eden dev` | Start backend and Flutter in watch mode |
| `eden check` | Run lint + test together |
| `eden down` | Stop local infrastructure (docker compose down) |

## AI Guidance

- Keep backend contracts in `proto/` — update `.proto` files first, then `eden generate`
- Use eden_platform_flutter for shell orchestration (auth, company loading, navigation)
- Use eden_ui_flutter for reusable UI widgets and tokens
- Do not hand-edit files under `lib/src/gen/` — they are auto-generated
